    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Brady is delighted to bring to the market this charming mid-terrace bungalow, ideally situated on the north side of Drogheda, just minutes from the town centre.\n\nRecently refurbished throughout, the property is bright, spacious and presented in excellent condition. The refurbishment includes rewiring, new windows, and new front and rear doors.\n\nThe accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming sitting room, kitchen, utility room, one bedroom and a modern shower room. To the rear, the property benefits from a large, private garden which is not overlooked, providing an excellent outdoor space.\n\nThe location is highly convenient, with Drogheda Town Centre just a short walk away. A wide range of local amenities are also within easy walking distance, including shops, bars, restaurants, schools, Our Lady of Lourdes Hospital and a selection of parks and recreational facilities.\n\nThis property offers excellent potential and is ideally suited to a variety of buyers. Early viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate all that this home has to offer."
      },
